{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >///// GROW. SURVIVE. DESTROY!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hurricane.io is an online strategy game where you are the hurricane. You'll start as a tiny tropical storm, but by absorbing clouds you can get massive in no time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying cities charges special powers, but you'll shrink while on land. Activate your powers at the perfect time to unleash chaos on the world \u2060\u2014 and the competition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's right. You're not the only cyclone around, and angering a bigger hurricane might get you eaten. But when you're a Perfect Storm, the whole sky is yours to devour!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you survive? How big can you get? And how much destruction can you cause?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808050?t=1755188794","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808050?t=1755188794","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808050/59292c199a90db0271ffe3b1a8cb65e2c15b7e4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755188794","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808050/59292c199a90db0271ffe3b1a8cb65e2c15b7e4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755188794","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >///// GROW. SURVIVE. DESTROY!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hurricane.io is an online strategy game where you are the hurricane. You'll start as a tiny tropical storm, but by absorbing clouds you can get massive in no time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying cities charges special powers, but you'll shrink while on land. Activate your powers at the perfect time to unleash chaos on the world \u2060\u2014 and the competition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's right. You're not the only cyclone around, and angering a bigger hurricane might get you eaten. But when you're a Perfect Storm, the whole sky is yours to devour!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you survive? How big can you get? And how much destruction can you cause?</p>","developers":["Vidreya Gaming"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808050/74186b49ee66967ccbe43d5b2cd782fdbf92a320/header.jpg?t=1755188794","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3808050/1297205292/5f29de9c04f3d4e1136e964f28de599435f78718/1754623725/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755188792","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3808050/1297205292/5f29de9c04f3d4e1136e964f28de599435f78718/1754623725/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755188792","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3808050/1297205292/5f29de9c04f3d4e1136e964f28de599435f78718/1754623725/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755188792","id":257180117,"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257180117/af199752ef64741873f42bf23a453f2bd39682ea/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755188792"}],"name":"Hurricane.io","package_groups":[],"pc_